S202. They are also the prerequisite for any future description rewrite.
S203. - **Distribution channels**: a Claude Code `marketplace.json`, `npx skills`, `gh skill`, or a Codex plugin.
S204. These are outward-facing.
S205. Plugin namespacing (`/plugin:skill`) also conflicts with the bare-name cross-reference invariant.
S206. - **Codex adapters for `/deferred`, `/fix-issue`, `/license-audit`**, as manual-only skills with `agents/openai.yaml`.
S207. R1.6 is the groundwork.
S208. - **Tables of contents for long `references/` files** (Anthropic's partial-read guidance).
S209. This needs a reliable detector first; a crude grep was not one.
S210. - **Splitting `writing-skills`** below 500 body lines (R1.7's warning).
S211. - **A versioning policy**: CHANGELOG, git tags, and `metadata.version` bumps.
S212. - **Skill security scanning** (e.g. Cisco's `skill-scanner`).
S213. The repo has no CI.
S214. - **License travel for single-file agents.** `agents/code-reviewer.md` and `agents/task-reviewer.md` are distilled from superpowers and install as single files without `LICENSE-superpowers`: the same gap R4 closes for skills.

## Sources and verification notes
S215. - `specs/completed/agent-skills-best-practices.md`: the survey.
S216. Its Claude Code numbers are secondary; `specs/guides/claude-code-customization-guide.md` governs Claude Code facts.
S217. Its 2026-10-03 re-verification against official docs (at 2.1.288) landed on main via lowmason/agent-skills#19 (merge `c33bc99`).
S218. - [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io/specification): the six frontmatter fields, the `compatibility` ≤ 500 limit, and `metadata` as a string-to-string map.
S219. - [Codex skills docs](https://developers.openai.com/codex/skills): the `agents/openai.yaml` `policy.allow_implicit_invocation` key.
S220. - uv documentation: a script with inline metadata runs in its own environment even inside a project.
S221. R3.8's pyproject run verifies this rather than assuming it.
S222. - Runtime measurements in "Measured baseline" were taken on 2026-10-03 with Gemini CLI 0.46.0 and Codex CLI 0.154.0, on this machine's installed skill set (93 skills in Codex's listing).
</spec>

